<title>USA: IMM currency futures lower, marks expand losses.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures lower, marks expand losses.</headline>
<text>
<p>April 25 - Most IMM currency futures lower, with key contracts expanding losses after Treasury's Rubin comments. Rubin repeated that dollar policy is unchanged, but G7 will discuss forex and the Japan's economy and trade. June marks fell to $0.5807, below the contract low settlement of $0.5809.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750/))</p>
